roosTable -- Creates hashtable of Jan-Erik Roos' examples of quadratic ideals
*****************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        H = roosTable ()
  * Outputs:
      * H, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, 

Description
===========

This is based on Main Theorem and Tables 3-7 in "Homological properties of the
homology algebra of the Koszul complex of a local ring: Examples and questions"
by Jan-Erik Roos, Journal of Algebra 465 (2016) 399-436. The ideals in this
table exemplify 83 known cases of bi-graded Poincar\'e series of quadratic
ideals of embedding dimension four in characteristic zero. The coefficient
field is QQ.

